ss=\\\"italic\\\">Could you come for an interview?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Please bring in your resume and employment history.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you come in for an interview?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You need to bring your social security card.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you prefer a morning or afternoon interview?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We want you to start next week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you have any questions?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "successful "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "getting what you want"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her job interview was successful."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you ask about a job."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "employee"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works at a company"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is a new employee at the company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "employer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person or company who hires  employees "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My new employer wants me to 